title: "Email Manager — AI 邮件管理助手"
abstract: "An AI email assistant that sorts a Microsoft mailbox into S/A/B/C and emails a summary report, built for HKUST students. It talks to Microsoft Graph directly, so nothing has to be installed besides the app itself. / 面向香港科技大学（HKUST）学生的邮箱自动分级（S/A/B/C）与总结工具。直接对接 Microsoft Graph，除程序本身外不需要安装任何东西。"
